  "description": "The gRPC integration for NResilience: a client interceptor that runs a resilience policy around each call, classifies gRPC status codes, writes a per-attempt deadline the peer can read, scopes breakers and budgets per service, and reports nested retries. Retrying a gRPC client through the HTTP handler does nothing - every gRPC call is a POST - which is what this package exists to fix.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
